            {
                "entry_id": "5f214c24-fd21-34c2-91f6-692e6ba4bb11",
                "word": "superpower",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "82941a47-b685-30dc-9d28-f384a4bd4c00",
                        "entry_id": "5f214c24-fd21-34c2-91f6-692e6ba4bb11",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Superpuissance, en parlant d’un État."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Anglicism",
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "46f89428-ed04-4b65-80e1-d4b5ef5a96ab",
                                "sense_id": "82941a47-b685-30dc-9d28-f384a4bd4c00",
                                "text": "Comme je l'ai mentionné, le pays serait même devenue une superpower dans la sphère de la moralité."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "919b7fb0-6f7e-44f2-b730-4520b968122d",
                        "source_entry_id": "5f214c24-fd21-34c2-91f6-692e6ba4bb11",
                        "source_sense_id": "82941a47-b685-30dc-9d28-f384a4bd4c00",
                        "target_lang_word": "superpower",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "superpower",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a6ac94ec-3f1c-3815-b9ed-f8987cfe1848",
                                        "entry_id": "37b8deaa-e2bb-392c-a637-5051e0c533ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sovereign state with dominant status on the globe and a very advanced military, especially the United States or formerly the Soviet Union."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e79edbdb-6e9e-4208-9b29-db764021f12a",
                                                "sense_id": "a6ac94ec-3f1c-3815-b9ed-f8987cfe1848",
                                                "text": "Our superpower competition will be reunified Germany (perhaps together with its European satellites) and expanding Japan (perhaps allied with China, if they can bring that off)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84acfb17-fe4d-4672-a58d-bfdd3c6b5b0f",
                                                "sense_id": "a6ac94ec-3f1c-3815-b9ed-f8987cfe1848",
                                                "text": "The year 1945 marked the end of Europe's global hegemony and confirmed the US and the Soviet Union as global superpowers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d373b6d7-cc55-4726-9bde-332941365cdf",
                                                "sense_id": "a6ac94ec-3f1c-3815-b9ed-f8987cfe1848",
                                                "text": "Deals unveiled during US President Donald Trump's recent visit to the region showcased Saudi Arabia and the United Arab Emirates' aspirations to become AI superpowers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff9bed0d-3c5b-3853-80f3-18dae481bdb6",
                                        "entry_id": "37b8deaa-e2bb-392c-a637-5051e0c533ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An extraordinary physical or mental ability, especially possessed by a superhero or supervillain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe845cfc-f09a-4650-88ea-42bcfca1b97b",
                                                "sense_id": "ff9bed0d-3c5b-3853-80f3-18dae481bdb6",
                                                "text": "Trump’s superpower at home has long been to command intense loyalty from fellow Republicans."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c38ed7a2-e54d-4fe8-b894-cc148fa598c0",
                                                "sense_id": "ff9bed0d-3c5b-3853-80f3-18dae481bdb6",
                                                "text": "Administered in such a way, in that superpowers it assures."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e03cd5d-ed86-40da-b819-fadcb5749ccc",
                                                "sense_id": "ff9bed0d-3c5b-3853-80f3-18dae481bdb6",
                                                "text": "This is his superpower, I think. The comic geek always has one, and Oliver's is a poker face that would leave even the Holy Trinity guessing what he's thinking."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "198a443d-fc84-42a7-92b4-04393f0890b6",
                                                "sense_id": "ff9bed0d-3c5b-3853-80f3-18dae481bdb6",
                                                "text": "If I could have a superpower id^([sic]) want to be able to teleport. I hate walking and driving gives me headaches."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b184c9bc-be48-4bd3-8989-4fdc512ccde6",
                                                "sense_id": "ff9bed0d-3c5b-3853-80f3-18dae481bdb6",
                                                "text": "This is an incredible superpower on demand that would have been unimaginable at any previous time in history."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7136ec9b-2ae0-3601-80dc-ca1d3aa76044",
                                        "entry_id": "37b8deaa-e2bb-392c-a637-5051e0c533ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Electricity generated in a large plant that is tied into a regional network, on a larger scale than was common in the early years of commercial electricity production."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "36041b44-b920-37bc-87b7-69b43b570f5d",
                                        "entry_id": "37b8deaa-e2bb-392c-a637-5051e0c533ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A tetration."
